@startuml
' Use-case diagram — Smart Campus study room booking
' Two actors, outside the boundary. Six use cases, inside it.
' Associations kept only where a person actually triggers the function.

left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus study room booking" {
  usecase "View availability"      as UC01
  usecase "Book room"              as UC02
  usecase "Cancel booking"         as UC03
  usecase "Block or unblock room"  as UC04
  usecase "Review usage"           as UC05
  usecase "Send confirmation"      as UC06
}

Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03
Administrator --> UC04
Administrator --> UC05

' UC06 Send confirmation has no actor edge on purpose: the system generates the
' confirmation itself once a booking or cancellation is processed. No person
' requests it directly, so no association is drawn to it.

@enduml
